index 0000000..31843fb
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/5279.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Added an optional ``retry_after_jitter`` parameter to ``urllib3.util.Retry``, so that a
+fleet of clients does not retry at the same instant. It defaults to ``0.0``, which keeps
+the existing behavior: a ``Retry-After`` wait is exactly as long as the server requested.
+When set, a random number of seconds between zero and ``retry_after_jitter`` is added to
+a positive ``Retry-After`` wait, never shortening it, and the resulting wait is still
+limited by ``retry_after_max``.
